                                "sense_id": "91bbddf3-f453-3710-a5bc-4028de8f0611",
                                "text": "That is an extraordinary achievement for a spiky ball of genetic material coated in fatty chemicals called lipids, and which measures 80 billionths of a metre in diameter. Humanity has been brought low by a very humble assailant."
                            }
